### Registrieren (201 + Auth-Cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### Registrieren mit ungültigen Daten (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "keine-email",
  "password": "kurz"
}

### Login (200 + Auth-Cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### Login mit falschem Passwort (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "FalschesPasswort999!"
}

### Logout (204 + Logout-Cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: access_token={{token}}
